      "user_message": "Reply to the email from Michael Chen (subject: 'Monthly Budget Report Request') and include the spending information I shared with you earlier that you saved to memory.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should reply to an email from Michael Chen (michael.chen@accounting.com) containing the information: I spent $450 on groceries this week and $120 on gas",
      "agent_response": "I located Michael Chen’s unread message (\"Monthly Budget Report Request,\" 2026-01-17). I attempted to send the reply but outbound sending is blocked in this session. Below is a ready-to-send reply you can paste into your mail client — or tell me if you want me to try sending or saving it as a draft (I can attempt again if you’d like).\n\nProposed reply (Subject: Re: Monthly Budget Report Request)\n\nHi Michael,\n\nThanks — here is the spending breakdown for this week as requested:\n- Groceries: $450\n- Gas (transportation): $120\n\nLet me know if you need any receipts or additional details for the report.\n\nBest regards,  \nVince\n\nWould you like me to:\n- Try sending this reply now? (I’ll attempt to send using the email tool), or\n- Save it as a draft, or\n- Change the wording before you send it yourself?",
      "duration_s": 46.45,
      "passed": false,
      "success_check": {
        "type": "composite",
